              "lines": [
                "## <span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">Research output of the Galician universities</span>\n",
                "\n",
                "UDC, USC and UVIGO, 2015–2025. Articles and reviews from OpenAlex, processed with a medallion pipeline (bronze → silver → gold) in Databricks. Full counting: a shared work counts for each university.\n",
